# UI controls come from `@bokdy/ui`

Feature code imports interactive controls from `@bokdy/ui`. Do not render the browser's `<select>`, `<textarea>`, `<input type="date">`, `<input type="time">`, or `<input type="datetime-local">`. Do not hand-roll a dialog, menu, or listbox with `useState` and a positioned div.

| Need | Use |
| --- | --- |
| Choice list | `Select`, or admin `PopoverCommandSelect` |
| Long text | `Textarea` |
| Date | `DatePicker` (`YYYY-MM-DD`) |
| Time | `TimePicker` (`HH:MM`) |
| On / off | `Switch` |
| Range | `Slider` |
| Chip or filter pill | `Toggle` / `ToggleGroup` |
| Confirm, no form | `AlertDialog` |
| Dialog / drawer with a form | `Dialog` / `Sheet` |
| Crumbs | `Breadcrumb` |
| Empty list | `Empty` |
| Page controls | `Pagination` |
| Loading | `Spinner` |
| Shortcut | `Kbd` |
| Scrollable pane | `ScrollArea` |
| Text, search | `Input` / `InputGroup` |
| Primary action | `Button` default, or admin `softDirectoryPrimaryBtn` |
| White surface button | `Button` `variant="outline"`, or admin `softDirectorySecondaryBtn` |
| Quiet icon action | `Button` `variant="ghost"` |
| Section hint | `InfoHint`, or `hint` on `EntityDetailPanel` / `EntitySectionHead` |
| Relation to another entity | admin `EntityRelationLink` |

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<select value={status} onChange={…} />
<input type="date" value={day} />
<button className="rounded-xl bg-white hover:bg-sky-50" />
<Button className="hover:bg-sky-500 hover:bg-muted/40" />
<p>{t("branchHint")}</p>
<DataListEmpty description={t("branchHint")} />

// ✅ GOOD
<DatePicker value={day} onChange={setDay} locale={locale} placeholder={t("pickDate")} />
<TimePicker value={start} onChange={setStart} hourLabel={t("hour")} minuteLabel={t("minute")} />
<Button variant="outline" />
<Button className={softDirectorySecondaryBtn} />
<InfoHint text={t("branchHint")} />
<EntityDetailPanel hint={t("branchHint")} />
<EntityRelationLink href={`/branches/${branch.id}`}>{branch.name}</EntityRelationLink>
```

A field that points at another Bokdy record (branch, organization, court) uses `EntityRelationLink` from `apps/admin-web/components/entity/relation-link.tsx`. Do not put `text-sky-*` or `dark:text-sky-*` on that link. The color is the `--relation-link` token: sky-700 on a light surface, sky-300 in dark.

Allowed native inputs: `type="hidden"` and `type="file"`. A numeric range uses `Slider`.

A hint explains a section. Do not print it as body copy, an empty-state description, or a paragraph. Pass it to `InfoHint`, or to the `hint` prop on `EntityDetailPanel` / `EntitySectionHead`, which already renders `InfoHint`.

## Do not restyle a control that already exists

Pick the component and variant from the table. Do not invent a second hover, border, or fill on the call site. Two `hover:bg-*` classes on one element fight, and the later one wins, so the screen silently drifts from the shared style.

Hover lives in the primitive: `outline` and `softDirectorySecondaryBtn` hover to sky, `ghost` stays a muted wash, the default `Button` stays a solid fill. Admin title-row actions import `softDirectoryPrimaryBtn` and `softDirectorySecondaryBtn` from `@/components/data-list`. Do not copy those class strings into a feature.

If a look is missing, change the variant once in `packages/ui/src/ui/button.tsx` (or the soft constants) and export it from `packages/ui/src/index.ts`. Do not ship the browser control, or a one-off className, as a stand-in. App-only compositions (nav combobox, filters) stay in `apps/<app>/components/`.
